The software used to create these diagrams did not have a 5V battery and the motor drivers we used. Therefore these diagrams are not a fully accuarate representation of the final circuit. The circuit we built used a PCB to provide 5V to the breadbord. The motor drivers were connected to digital pins 3-6 and 8-11 on the Arduino via the breadboard. The step motors were connected to the drivers via built-in wiring.
